## ProductTagsApi

### Add product tags to pin
## Add product tags to pin
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/pins/{{pin_id}}/product_tags
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "product_tags": "<string>"
}


### Delete product tags from pin
## Delete product tags from pin
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/pins/{{pin_id}}/product_tags/bulk-delete
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "product_tags": "<string>"
}


### Get product tags for pin
## Get product tags for pin
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/pins/{{pin_id}}/product_tags
Accept: application/json
